{
  "id": "scav",
  "speaker": "Corvin",
  "entries": [
    {
      "node": "split",
      "when": [
        "can:scav.atLift"
      ]
    },
    {
      "node": "stolen",
      "when": [
        "can:scav.stole"
      ]
    },
    {
      "node": "stall",
      "when": [
        "can:scav.stall"
      ]
    },
    {
      "node": "busy",
      "when": [
        "can:scav.dealt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "node": "first",
      "when": [
        "!knows:scav:met"
      ]
    },
    {
      "node": "hub"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "first": {
      "lines": [
        "Corvin. I find things, and I sell them to people who didn’t find them.",
        "There’s a battery up in the plant room. Hatch at the top of the guest stair is barred from the other side, and I don’t do rungs."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "what",
          "label": "What’s in it for me?",
          "next": "offer"
        },
        {
          "id": "no",
          "label": "Not interested.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.decline",
            "say:scav:Then I’ll find a way. I always do."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "offer": {
      "lines": [
        "There’s an inspection lamp on the service trolley up there. Bright, holds a charge. Get me up there and it’s yours. The battery’s mine."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "deal",
          "label": "Deal.",
          "detail": "Open the hatch from above (exit stair off the loading floor). He brings the battery down.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.deal",
            "say:scav:Pleasure. Open that hatch and I’ll meet you up top."
          ],
          "primary": true
        },
        {
          "id": "how",
          "label": "How would I get up there?",
          "next": "how"
        },
        {
          "id": "no",
          "label": "No.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.decline",
            "say:scav:Suit yourself."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "how": {
      "lines": [
        "Exit stair, far end of the loading floor. Rungs all the way. Then along the top corridor to the hatch."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "deal",
          "label": "Deal.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.deal",
            "say:scav:Pleasure."
          ],
          "primary": true
        },
        {
          "id": "no",
          "label": "I’ll think about it.",
          "effects": [
            "end"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "busy": {
      "lines": [
        "Hatch open yet? I’m not getting any younger."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "bye",
          "label": "Working on it.",
          "effects": [
            "end"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "split": {
      "lines": [
        "Freight cage takes one person and the trolley. I’ll run it down, you take the rungs. See you at the bottom.",
        "(He’d be at the lever. The battery and your lamp are both on the trolley.)"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ride",
          "label": "We both ride. I’ll squeeze in.",
          "detail": "You go down with him and the load.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.ride",
            "say:scav:Cosy."
          ],
          "primary": true
        },
        {
          "id": "lamp",
          "label": "Hand me the lamp first.",
          "detail": "Your share comes off the trolley before you split up.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.takeLamp",
            "say:scav:Don’t trust me? Smart."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "trust",
          "label": "Go ahead. I’ll take the rungs.",
          "detail": "He controls the lift and everything on the trolley.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.trust",
            "say:scav:See you at the bottom."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "stall": {
      "lines": [
        "{stallLine}"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "bye",
          "label": "Just looking.",
          "effects": [
            "end"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "stolen": {
      "lines": [
        "{stallLine}"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "confront",
          "label": "That’s my lamp.",
          "detail": "Take it back. He won’t let go easily.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.confront",
            "say:scav:Prove it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bargain",
          "label": "Buy it back",
          "detail": "Two coins or four fasteners.",
          "when": [
            "can:scav.bargain"
          ],
          "locked": "You can’t afford his price (two coins or four fasteners).",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.bargain",
            "say:scav:Pleasure doing business. Again."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "warn",
          "label": "Warn Wren about him",
          "detail": "She’ll know what he did.",
          "when": [
            "can:scav.warn"
          ],
          "locked": "Wren isn’t around to warn.",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.warn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bye",
          "label": "Walk away.",
          "effects": [
            "end"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "hub": {
      "lines": [
        "Still here. Still looking up that stair."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "deal",
          "label": "Is the lamp offer still on?",
          "effects": [
            "do:scav.deal",
            "say:scav:Always."
          ],
          "when": [
            "can:scav.waiting"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bye",
          "label": "See you.",
          "effects": [
            "end"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}